  "scope": "Eight unchanged complete Badge/widget/render/default, CircleAvatar and MediaQuery.withNoTextScaling declarations execute on explicit finite parent Widget/context/theme/decoration/text/image/render constraints receivers. M3 branch only; full original text/image pipeline/layout parents/renderer/engine and general const/ARGB role reference ABI are separate. Render positioning/intrinsic/dry baseline algorithms execute unchanged; finite child intrinsic values and explicit palettes are inputs. Public count is an exact nonnegative JS safe-integer adapter; values outside the safe range are rejected rather than rounded. ImageProvider/ErrorListener and AnimatedContainer use existing Core owners. Core MediaData projection preserves typed inherited getters on original receivers and retains host insets/metadata."
